---
title: "Figure 3.X. Dermatologist Side Process Flow"
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Dermatologist Opens DermaTrack]
    B --> C[Login]
    C --> D{Are credentials\nvalid?}

    D -- No --> C
    D -- Yes --> E[System Checks User Role]
    E --> F{Is the user role\nDermatologist?}

    F -- No --> G[Deny Access]
    G --> Z1([End])

    F -- Yes --> H[Open Dermatologist Dashboard]
    H --> I[View Assigned or\nShared Patients]
    I --> J{Has the patient\nshared data with\nthe dermatologist?}

    J -- No --> K[Show No Accessible\nPatient Data]
    K --> Z2([End])

    J -- Yes --> L[Dermatologist Selects Patient]
    L --> M[System Displays Patient Profile,\nMedical History, Scan History,\nSeverity Results, Notes,\nand Generated Reports]
    M --> N[Dermatologist Reviews\nPatient Information\n&#40;API severity output is supporting\ninformation only — not a diagnosis&#41;]

    N --> O{Does the dermatologist\nneed to add a note?}
    O -- Yes --> P[Add Doctor Note to Scan]
    P --> Q[Save Doctor Note]
    Q --> R{Does the dermatologist need\nto issue or update\na prescription?}
    O -- No --> R

    R -- Yes --> S[Create or Update Prescription]
    S --> T[Save Prescription]
    T --> U{Does the dermatologist need\nto create or update\na treatment plan?}
    R -- No --> U

    U -- Yes --> V[Create or Update Treatment Plan]
    V --> W[Save Treatment Plan]
    W --> X{Does the dermatologist\nneed to message\nthe patient?}
    U -- No --> X

    X -- Yes --> Y[Compose and Send Message]
    Y --> YA[Save Message]
    YA --> Z[System Updates\nPatient-Accessible Records]
    X -- No --> Z

    Z --> Z3([End])

    style A fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z1 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z2 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Z3 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style D fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style F fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style J fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style O fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style R fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style U fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
    style X fill:#dce8f5,stroke:#336699
